# needs-review
msgid "A contact field is missing or badly formed: correct the contact."
msgstr "Tá réimse teagmhála in easnamh nó mícheart: ceartaigh an teagmháil."

# needs-review
msgid "A value is out of its allowed range or format: correct it."
msgstr "Tá luach lasmuigh dá raon nó dá fhormáid cheadaithe: ceartaigh é."

# needs-review
msgid "An account already has this name: choose another name."
msgstr "Tá cuntas leis an ainm seo ann cheana: roghnaigh ainm eile."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "An account is already named {account}. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Tá cuntas darb ainm {account} ann cheana. Níor sábháladh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "An unexpected error occurred: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Tharla earráid gan choinne: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "Authorization code given by the current registrar"
msgstr "Cód údaraithe ón gcláraitheoir reatha"

# needs-review
msgid "Authorization code of the domain (shown in the Gandi administration)"
msgstr "Cód údaraithe an fhearainn (taispeántar é i riarachán Gandi)"

# needs-review
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Deimhnigh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Confirm on the production account {account}: {action}"
msgstr "Deimhnigh ar an gcuntas táirgeachta {account}: {action}"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Confirm on the sandbox account {account}: {action}"
msgstr "Deimhnigh ar an gcuntas tástála (sandbox) {account}: {action}"

# needs-review
msgid "Confirmation - gandi-mcp"
msgstr "Deimhniú - gandi-mcp"

# needs-review
msgid "Create a snapshot of the zone first (automatic snapshots are off)"
msgstr "Griangraf den chrios a chruthú ar dtús (tá griangraif uathoibríocha múchta)"

# needs-review
msgid ""
"Create a snapshot of the zone first (automatic snapshots are on: LiveDNS also saves the zone "
"after each change)"
msgstr ""
"Griangraf den chrios a chruthú ar dtús (tá griangraif uathoibríocha ar siúl: sábhálann LiveDNS an"
" crios tar éis gach athraithe freisin)"

# needs-review
msgid "Create a token in the Gandi administration"
msgstr "Cruthaigh comhartha i riarachán Gandi"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Enter the Personal Access Token of the production account {account}."
msgstr "Iontráil an Personal Access Token don chuntas táirgeachta {account}."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Enter the Personal Access Token of the sandbox account {account}."
msgstr "Iontráil an Personal Access Token don chuntas tástála (sandbox) {account}."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the value asked for (at most {max_length} characters, no control character) to confirm, or "
"refuse the operation."
msgstr ""
"Iontráil an luach a iarradh ({max_length} carachtar ar a mhéad, gan carachtar rialaithe) chun "
"deimhniú, nó diúltaigh don oibríocht."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi answered in an unexpected way: try again later, or report it."
msgstr "D'fhreagair Gandi ar bhealach gan choinne: bain triail eile as ar ball, nó tuairiscigh é."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi cannot be reached right now. Nothing was saved: try again later."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir teagmháil a dhéanamh le Gandi faoi láthair. Níor sábháladh aon rud: bain triail eile as"
" ar ball."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi cannot be reached right now: try again later."
msgstr "Ní féidir teagmháil a dhéanamh le Gandi faoi láthair: bain triail eile as ar ball."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi could not give a price right now: nothing was bought. Try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir le Gandi praghas a thabhairt anois: níor ceannaíodh aon rud. Bain triail eile as i"
" gceann tamaillín."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi did not find this resource."
msgstr "Níor aimsigh Gandi an acmhainn seo."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi gives no price for this duration: choose another duration."
msgstr "Ní thugann Gandi praghas don tréimhse seo: roghnaigh tréimhse eile."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"Gandi gives several prices for this domain right now (launch period): nothing was bought. Try "
"again later, or order it in the Gandi administration."
msgstr ""
"Tugann Gandi roinnt praghsanna don fhearann seo faoi láthair (tréimhse seolta): níor ceannaíodh "
"aon rud. Bain triail eile as níos déanaí, nó ordaigh é i riarachán Gandi."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi refused the submitted data."
msgstr "Dhiúltaigh Gandi na sonraí a seoladh."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"Gandi refused the token of this account, which may be invalid or expired: replace the token of "
"the account."
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh Gandi comhartha an chuntais seo, a d'fhéadfadh a bheith neamhbhailí nó imithe in éag: "
"athsholáthair comhartha an chuntais."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi refused this operation: the token may lack the required permission or have expired."
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh Gandi an oibríocht seo: b'fhéidir nach bhfuil an cead riachtanach ag an gcomhartha nó "
"go bhfuil sé imithe in éag."

# needs-review
msgid "Gandi refused this order when checking it: nothing was bought."
msgstr "Dhiúltaigh Gandi don ordú seo agus é á sheiceáil: níor ceannaíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"Gandi refused this token for this environment. Nothing was saved: ask the assistant to open a new"
" page, then enter a valid token."
msgstr ""
"Dhiúltaigh Gandi an comhartha seo don timpeallacht seo. Níor sábháladh aon rud: iarr ar an "
"gcúntóir leathanach nua a oscailt, ansin iontráil comhartha bailí."

# needs-review
msgid "No Gandi account is configured: add one first."
msgstr "Níl aon chuntas Gandi cumraithe: cuir ceann leis ar dtús."

# needs-review
msgid "No account has this name: list the accounts to check the name."
msgstr "Níl an t-ainm seo ar aon chuntas: liostaigh na cuntais chun an t-ainm a sheiceáil."

# needs-review
msgid "Open this page to confirm or refuse the operation."
msgstr "Oscail an leathanach seo chun an oibríocht a dheimhniú nó a dhiúltú."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Open this page to enter the Personal Access Token of the account {account}."
msgstr "Oscail an leathanach seo chun an Personal Access Token don chuntas {account} a iontráil."

# needs-review
msgid "Operation confirmed. Go back to the conversation and ask the assistant to continue."
msgstr "Oibríocht deimhnithe. Fill ar an gcomhrá agus iarr ar an gcúntóir leanúint ar aghaidh."

# needs-review
msgid "Operation refused. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Oibríocht diúltaithe. Níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "Personal Access Token"
msgstr "Personal Access Token"

# needs-review
msgid "Personal Access Token - gandi-mcp"
msgstr "Personal Access Token - gandi-mcp"

# needs-review
msgid "Refuse"
msgstr "Diúltaigh"

# needs-review
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sábháil"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The account {account} is saved for the Gandi user {username}. You can close this page."
msgstr ""
"Tá an cuntas {account} sábháilte don úsáideoir Gandi {username}. Is féidir leat an leathanach seo"
" a dhúnadh."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The account {account} no longer exists. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Níl an cuntas {account} ann a thuilleadh. Níor sábháladh aon rud."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The account {account} was replaced or moved to another environment while this page was open. "
"Nothing was saved: ask the assistant to open a new page."
msgstr ""
"Athsholáthraíodh an cuntas {account} nó bogadh go timpeallacht eile é fad a bhí an leathanach seo"
" oscailte. Níor sábháladh aon rud: iarr ar an gcúntóir leathanach nua a oscailt."

# needs-review
msgid "The confirmation was not given in time: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Níor tugadh an deimhniú in am: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"The file could not be read or written in the work directory: check its permissions and that it is"
" UTF-8 text."
msgstr ""
"Níorbh fhéidir an comhad a léamh ná a scríobh san eolaire oibre: seiceáil a cheadanna agus gur "
"téacs UTF-8 é."

# needs-review
msgid "The keyring of the system is unavailable. Nothing was saved: unlock or install it, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Níl fáinne eochracha an chórais ar fáil. Níor sábháladh aon rud: díghlasáil nó suiteáil é, ansin "
"bain triail eile as."

# needs-review
msgid "The keyring of the system is unavailable: unlock or install it, then try again."
msgstr "Níl fáinne eochracha an chórais ar fáil: díghlasáil nó suiteáil é, ansin bain triail eile as."

# needs-review
msgid "The operation conflicts with the current state of the resource at Gandi."
msgstr "Tagann an oibríocht salach ar staid reatha na hacmhainne ag Gandi."

# needs-review
msgid "The operation was refused: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Diúltaíodh don oibríocht: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "The page to enter the token could not be opened in a browser."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir an leathanach chun an comhartha a iontráil a oscailt i mbrabhsálaí."

# needs-review
msgid "The preferences of gandi-mcp cannot be read or saved: check the preferences file."
msgstr "Ní féidir sainroghanna gandi-mcp a léamh ná a shábháil: seiceáil comhad na sainroghanna."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"The preferences of gandi-mcp cannot be saved. Nothing was saved: check the preferences file, then"
" try again."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir sainroghanna gandi-mcp a shábháil. Níor sábháladh aon rud: seiceáil comhad na "
"sainroghanna, ansin bain triail eile as."

# needs-review
msgid "The price changed since the confirmation: nothing was bought. Ask again to see the new price."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh an praghas ón deimhniú: níor ceannaíodh aon rud. Iarr arís chun an praghas nua a "
"fheiceáil."

# needs-review
msgid "The removal of this account was interrupted: remove the account again to finish it."
msgstr "Cuireadh isteach ar bhaint an chuntais seo: bain an cuntas arís chun é a chríochnú."

# needs-review
msgid "The snapshot of the zone could not be taken: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir griangraf den chrios a chruthú: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "The token of this account is missing from the keyring: replace the token of the account."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhartha an chuntais seo ar iarraidh ón bhfáinne eochracha: athsholáthair comhartha an "
"chuntais."

# needs-review
msgid "The value asked on the confirmation page is missing: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Tá an luach a iarradh ar an leathanach deimhnithe in easnamh: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "This account cannot use this organization: list its organizations to choose one."
msgstr ""
"Ní féidir leis an gcuntas seo an eagraíocht seo a úsáid: liostaigh a chuid eagraíochtaí chun "
"ceann a roghnú."

# needs-review
msgid "This account is read-only: write operations are refused."
msgstr "Is cuntas inléite amháin é seo: diúltaítear d'oibríochtaí scríbhneoireachta."

# needs-review
msgid "This account name is not valid: use 1 to 40 letters, digits, hyphens or single spaces."
msgstr "Níl an t-ainm cuntais seo bailí: úsáid 1 go 40 litir, digit, fleiscín nó spás aonair."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"This account was made read-only in the meantime: nothing was changed. Ask again to allow write "
"operations, and confirm it."
msgstr ""
"Rinneadh cuntas inléite amháin den chuntas seo idir an dá linn: níor athraíodh aon rud. Iarr arís"
" scríobh a cheadú, agus deimhnigh é."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"This account was replaced or moved to another environment in the meantime: nothing was changed, "
"check the account and try again."
msgstr ""
"Athsholáthraíodh an cuntas seo nó bogadh go timpeallacht eile é idir an dá linn: níor athraíodh "
"aon rud, seiceáil an cuntas agus bain triail eile as."

# needs-review
msgid "This confirmation is unknown, already used or for another operation: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Tá an deimhniú seo anaithnid, úsáidte cheana nó d'oibríocht eile: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "This domain is not available for registration: nothing was bought."
msgstr "Níl an fearann seo ar fáil le clárú: níor ceannaíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "This file already exists in the work directory: choose another name, or ask to replace it."
msgstr ""
"Tá an comhad seo ann cheana san eolaire oibre: roghnaigh ainm eile, nó iarr go gcuirfí ceann eile"
" ina áit."

# needs-review
msgid "This file does not exist in the work directory: check its name."
msgstr "Níl an comhad seo san eolaire oibre: seiceáil a ainm."

# needs-review
msgid "This file is too large to be read: nothing was changed."
msgstr "Tá an comhad seo rómhór le léamh: níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"This file path is not allowed: give a path inside the work directory, without .. nor a drive "
"letter."
msgstr ""
"Ní cheadaítear an chonair comhaid seo: tabhair conair laistigh den eolaire oibre, gan .. agus gan"
" litir tiomántáin."

# needs-review
msgid "This is not a valid Personal Access Token."
msgstr "Ní Personal Access Token bailí é seo."

# needs-review
msgid "This is not a valid Personal Access Token: copy it again from the Gandi administration."
msgstr "Ní Personal Access Token bailí é seo: cóipeáil arís é ó riarachán Gandi."

# needs-review
msgid "This is not an organization identifier: use one returned by the list of organizations."
msgstr "Ní aitheantóir eagraíochta é seo: úsáid ceann a thugann liosta na n-eagraíochtaí ar ais."

# needs-review
msgid "This name is not a valid domain name: check its spelling, e.g. example.com."
msgstr "Ní ainm fearainn bailí é an t-ainm seo: seiceáil an litriú, m.sh. example.com."

# needs-review
msgid "This page has expired or was already used. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Tá an leathanach seo imithe in éag nó úsáidte cheana. Níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid ""
"This record name or type is not valid: use a name relative to the zone (@, www, _dmarc) and a "
"type such as A, MX or TXT."
msgstr ""
"Níl an t-ainm nó an cineál taifid seo bailí: úsáid ainm i gcoibhneas leis an gcrios (@, www, "
"_dmarc) agus cineál mar A, MX nó TXT."

# needs-review
msgid "This request was refused. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Diúltaíodh don iarratas seo. Níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
msgid "This tool can only be used from the Gandi app."
msgstr "Ní féidir an uirlis seo a úsáid ach ón aip Gandi."

# needs-review
msgid "Too many records for one replacement: export the zone, edit the file, then import it."
msgstr ""
"An iomarca taifead d'athsholáthar amháin: easpórtáil an crios, cuir an comhad in eagar, ansin "
"iompórtáil é."

# needs-review
msgid "Too many requests were sent to Gandi: wait a minute, then try again."
msgstr "Seoladh an iomarca iarratas chuig Gandi: fan nóiméad, ansin bain triail eile as."

# needs-review
msgid "Your confirmation could not be asked (no dialog, no browser): nothing was changed."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir do dheimhniú a iarraidh (gan dialóg, gan bhrabhsálaí): níor athraíodh aon rud."

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "accept the transfer of {domain} to another registrar: it will leave Gandi"
msgstr "glacadh le haistriú {domain} chuig cláraitheoir eile: fágfaidh sé Gandi"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "allow write operations on the account {account}"
msgstr "oibríochtaí scríbhneoireachta a cheadú ar an gcuntas {account}"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "change the owner details of {domain}"
msgstr "sonraí úinéara {domain} a athrú"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"change the owner details of {domain}, including its email address: you authorize Gandi to act as "
"your Designated Agent under the ICANN rules for this change"
msgstr ""
"sonraí úinéara {domain} a athrú, an seoladh ríomhphoist san áireamh: údaraíonn tú do Gandi "
"gníomhú mar do Ghníomhaire Ainmnithe faoi rialacha ICANN don athrú seo"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "decline the transfer of {domain} to another registrar"
msgstr "diúltú d'aistriú {domain} chuig cláraitheoir eile"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete all the records of the zone of {domain} (now: {count})"
msgstr "taifid uile chrios {domain} a scriosadh (anois: {count})"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the DNSSEC key {id} of {domain}"
msgstr "eochair DNSSEC {id} de {domain} a scriosadh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the domain {domain}: it will be lost for good"
msgstr "an fearann {domain} a scriosadh: caillfear go deo é"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the glue record {host} of {domain}"
msgstr "taifead glue {host} de {domain} a scriosadh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the records of {name} in the zone of {domain} (now: {count})"
msgstr "taifid {name} i gcrios {domain} a scriosadh (anois: {count})"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"delete the signing key {key} of the zone of {domain}: if its DS record is still published at the "
"registry, the domain may stop resolving"
msgstr ""
"an eochair shínithe {key} de chrios {domain} a scriosadh: má tá a taifead DS foilsithe fós ag an "
"gclárlann, d'fhéadfadh go stopfaí an fearann a réiteach"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the snapshot {snapshot} of the zone of {domain}"
msgstr "an griangraf {snapshot} de chrios {domain} a scriosadh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the web redirection of {host}"
msgstr "atreorú gréasáin {host} a scriosadh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "delete the {type} record of {name} in the zone of {domain} (values: {count})"
msgstr "an taifead {type} de {name} i gcrios {domain} a scriosadh (luachanna: {count})"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "disable DNSSEC for {domain}"
msgstr "DNSSEC a dhíchumasú do {domain}"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "dissociate the TSIG key {key} from the zone of {domain}"
msgstr "an eochair TSIG {key} a dhícheangal ó chrios {domain}"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"give the domain {domain} to a new owner; Gandi may charge for it depending on the extension, and "
"the amount is not known in advance"
msgstr ""
"an fearann {domain} a thabhairt d'úinéir nua; féadfaidh Gandi táille a ghearradh air ag brath ar "
"an iarmhír, agus níl an méid ar eolas roimh ré"

# needs-review
msgid "read the identity of the account"
msgstr "aitheantas an chuntais a léamh"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "redirect {host} to {url}, replacing its current DNS record"
msgstr "{host} a atreorú chuig {url}, ag athsholáthar a thaifid DNS reatha"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "register {domain} for {count} year: {price} including taxes"
msgid_plural "register {domain} for {count} years: {price} including taxes"
msgstr[0] "{domain} a chlárú ar feadh {count} bhliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[1] "{domain} a chlárú ar feadh {count} bhliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[2] "{domain} a chlárú ar feadh {count} bliana: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[3] "{domain} a chlárú ar feadh {count} mbliana: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[4] "{domain} a chlárú ar feadh {count} bliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "remove all the tags of {domain}"
msgstr "gach clib de {domain} a bhaint"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "remove the account {account} and its token from this computer"
msgstr "an cuntas {account} agus a chomhartha a bhaint den ríomhaire seo"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"remove values of the {type} record of {name} in the zone of {domain} (removed: {count}, left: "
"{left}; with none left, the record is deleted)"
msgstr ""
"luachanna a bhaint as an taifead {type} de {name} i gcrios {domain} (bainte: {count}, fágtha: "
"{left}; mura bhfuil aon cheann fágtha, scriostar an taifead)"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "renew {domain} for {count} year: {price} including taxes"
msgid_plural "renew {domain} for {count} years: {price} including taxes"
msgstr[0] "{domain} a athnuachan ar feadh {count} bhliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[1] "{domain} a athnuachan ar feadh {count} bhliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[2] "{domain} a athnuachan ar feadh {count} bliana: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[3] "{domain} a athnuachan ar feadh {count} mbliana: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"
msgstr[4] "{domain} a athnuachan ar feadh {count} bliain: {price} lena n-áirítear cánacha"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid "replace all the DNSSEC keys of {domain}"
msgstr "gach eochair DNSSEC de {domain} a athsholáthar"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"replace all the records of the zone of {domain} (now: {count}, after the change: {new}); its NS "
"records at @ are kept"
msgstr ""
"taifid uile chrios {domain} a athsholáthar (anois: {count}, tar éis an athraithe: {new}); "
"coimeádtar a thaifid NS ag @"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"replace all the records of the zone of {domain} (now: {count}, after the change: {new}); its NS "
"records at @ are removed too"
msgstr ""
"taifid uile chrios {domain} a athsholáthar (anois: {count}, tar éis an athraithe: {new}); "
"baintear a thaifid NS ag @ freisin"

# needs-review
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"replace all the records of the zone of {domain} with the snapshot {snapshot} (now: {count}, after"
" the change: {new})"
